<title>USA: Alcide Corp to purchase $1 mln of shares.</title>
<headline>Alcide Corp to purchase $1 mln of shares.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcide Corp said Thursday its board of directors has authorized the company to use an additional $1 million of the it's cash reserves to repurchase common stock.</p>
<p>Alcide, which develops and markets infection control products, has about 2.7 million shares outstanding.</p>
